      "type": "text",
      "text": "Until the end of the encounter or you are dying, each target has damage immunity 5 and can use a free triggered action once per turn whenever they are force moved to reduce the distance by half."
     }
    ],
    "preEffect": "",
    "powerRoll": null,
    "test": null,
    "effect": "",
