       {
        "id": "summoner-2-8-1",
        "name": "Control the Elements",
        "description": "\nWhenever you use Call Forth, you can spend essence to increase the size of one elemental minion you summon as shown on the following table.\n\n| Essence Cost | Size Change               |\n|:=============|===========================|\n| 1            | The minion becomes size 2 |\n| 3            | The minion becomes size 3 |\n| 5            | The minion becomes size 4 |\n\nEnlarged minions have their melee distance increased by 1 and inherent damage immunities doubled.",
        "type": "Text",
        "data": null
       },
       {
        "id": "summoner-2-8-2",
        "name": "Portfolio Champion",
        "description": "",
        "type": "Summon",
        "data": {
         "summons": [
          {
           "id": "summoner-2-8-2a",
           "name": "Dragon\u2019s Portent",
           "description": "\nYour champion is a Portent of a dragon yet to manifest. Through defending the innocent, you have made yourself and your elementals a close neighbor to the malice that threatens them. The dragon desires you bring their creation about, and lends you strength to see your justice through.\n\nAs a harbinger of ruin, the Dragon\u2019s Portent has incredibly potent impact and control of the environment. Their final shape has yet to be determined; use this to your advantage and call upon the affinity that will end conflict the quickest.",
