       {
        "id": "summoner-3-8-1",
        "name": "The Archfey's Will",
        "description": "\nThe characteristic scores of you and each of your fey minions are considered 1 higher for the purposes of resisting potencies. If a characteristic would hit a maximum value this way, that maximum value also increases by 1.\n\nAdditionally, any of your fey minions\u2019 traits that affect adjacent creatures and/or the area within 1 or more squares of them have that distance increased by 1 square.",
        "type": "Text",
        "data": null
